"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of or currently have any of the following conditions:\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"cardiovascular disease, including hypertension, heart failure, myocardial infarction, or stroke\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"pulmonary disease, including chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), asthma, or pulmonary embolism\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"hepatic disease, including cirrhosis, liver failure, or liver transplant\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"renal disease, including chronic kidney disease, kidney failure, or kidney transplant\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"OR\": {\n                                        \"left\": {\n                                          \"raw_text\": \"hematologic disease, including anemia, bleeding disorders, or blood clotting disorders\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          